Name: notifysocket
Type: STRING
Default-Value: {configdirectory}/socket/notify
Last-Modified: UNRELEASED

Unix domain socket that the mail notification daemon listens on.

By default, each notification is sent to it as a datagram, in the format
:cyrusman:`notifyd(8)` expects.  If the value is ``json:`` followed by a
path, each notification is instead written to that stream socket as one
line of JSON, and the listener must reply with one line holding a JSON
object whose ``status`` is ``OK``.  See
:ref:`imap-features-event-notifications-transport`.
